sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Viewer
    participant FE as DetailPage
    participant API as API
    participant D as MongoDB
    V->>FE: write comment
    FE->>API: POST /api/submissions/:id/comments
    API->>D: insert comment doc (submission, author, content)
    API-->>FE: comment populated
    V->>FE: reply to comment
    FE->>API: POST /api/comments/:id/replies
    API->>D: push embedded reply (author, content, likes, likedBy)
    API-->>FE: updated thread
    V->>FE: like reply
    FE->>API: POST /api/comments/:id/replies/:rid/like
    API->>D: toggle uid in likedBy and update likes count
    API-->>FE: liked, likes
